  "bio": "Linda Saul is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in black and gray realism, and her work truly stands out in the vibrant art scene of Etoy, Switzerland. Located at Atelier 209N in Les Ateliers de la Côte, Linda's commitment to cleanliness ensures a safe, hygienic experience for all her clients, reflecting her professionalism in every aspect of her craft. Whether you're considering a new tattoo or simply admiring the art, a visit to Linda's studio is a testament to her meticulous attention to detail and sanitary practices.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Etoy, Vaud, Switzerland\n\nRealistic tattoo - since 2004\n📍@thinktattoomontreux 📍Vullierens",
